  Until camfr3 3.0.0a3 this code was a C++ translation of ACM TOMS
  Algorithm 699 (Krogh and Snyder, 1991), which falls under ACM's software
  licence (non-commercial use only). It was rewritten on the basis of
  MATH77 (PORTING_JOURNAL.md, entry 64); the results are bit-identical.

The Jenkins-Traub polynomial root finder (ACM Algorithm 419, under ACM's
software licence) was removed in camfr3 and replaced by an eigenvalue
method (PORTING_JOURNAL.md, entry 56). No code under ACM's software licence
remains.
